      "problem_text": "A sector has perimeter 20 and area 25. Find the radius.",
      "answer": "r=5",
      "solution": "P=2r+r*theta=20, A=1/2 r^2 theta=25 => r^2 theta=50 => theta=50/r^2. Sub into P: 2r+r(50/r^2)=2r+50/r=20 => multiply r: 2r^2+50=20r => 2r^2-20r+50=0 => r^2-10r+25=0 => (r-5)^2=0 => r=5",
